baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 토지세 현황 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/land-tax/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 납세 내역 조회 (전체)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/land-tax/logs?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 납세 내역 조회 (납부 완료만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/land-tax/logs?page=0&size=10&status=PAID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 납세 내역 조회 (납부 실패만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/land-tax/logs?page=0&size=10&status=FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 납세 내역 조회 — 잘못된 status (400 에러 확인)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/land-tax/logs?status=WRONG
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
